     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ImplementationGuide rarelink-ig</b></p><a name=\"rarelink-ig\"> </a><a name=\"hcrarelink-ig\"> </a><h2>RareLinkImplementationGuide</h2><p>The official URL for this implementation guide is: </p><pre>https://rarelink.bih-charite.de/fhir/ImplementationGuide/rarelink-ig</pre><div><p>An Implementation Guide for RareLink Common Data Model, based on the ontology-based rare disease common data model (RD-CDM) harmonising the European Rare Disease Infrastructure Common Data Set, HL7 FHIR R4, and Phenopackets; and integrating the IPS 2.0.0 profiles and Genomics Reporting 3.0.0 profiles.</p>\n</div></div>"
